  "summary": {
    "text": "Claude Mythos 5 is a language model in Anthropic's Claude Mythos line, launched on 9 June 2026 alongside Claude Fable 5 and offered by invitation only through Project Glasswing to a small group of cyber defenders and infrastructure providers. Anthropic says it is the same underlying model as Fable 5 with safeguards lifted in some areas, deployed as an upgrade to Claude Mythos Preview.",
